ps Admissions Visit Meet an Admissions Counselor Accepted Students Support & Career Center for Academic Excellence Internships Only at Alverno Research Center for Women and Girls Thea Bowman Institute for Excellence and Leadership Registration Office of the Registrar Register for Classes Catalogs & Policies Campus Visit Us About Alverno About A Hispanic-Serving Institution First-Generation College Students Where All Belong Alverno's President Campus Events Campus Life Residence Life Dining Services Student Activities Greenhouse Campus Ministry Campus Safety Store A-Store (Alverno Gear) Resources Academic Academic Advising Career Studio Instructional Services Library Student Development and Success Study Abroad Technology Media Hub Tech Services Registration Office of the Registrar Register for Classes Accounts Student Accounts Financial Aid Health & Safety Wellness Campus Safety Additional Resources Resources for Parents All Student Resources Internal Event Brand Guide Alverno Publications 8 Abilities 8 Abilities Center for Learning and Assessment Support Volunteer Assessor Program Assessment Workshops & Consulting Alverno News Faculty Experts News/Blog A Magazine Apply Request Info Athletics Visit Events Alumnae Give My Alverno Career Education Internship Forms Internship Forms Career Student Resources Career Coaching Internship Advising Internship Advising Forms Recent Internships Handshake Alum Resources Handshake Employer Resources Hire an Intern Recruit a Grad Handshake Internship Forms Community Resources Online Resources Career Studio Team Office Hours & Contact Info About Internship Forms Alverno College utilizes an online system called Handshake to collect feedback on students' internship performance. Evaluations are sent digitally to internship supervisors. Below\n        are samples of the questions that are asked on the evaluations. Internship Job Description - To be completed by the supervisor and signed by the supervisor and\n                the student Internship- Learning Goals Form – To be completed by the student and signed by the\n                student and the supervisor Internship Mid-Semester Evaluation Sample – To be completed\n                by the student and signed by the student and the supervisor Internship Final Evaluation Sample - To be completed by the\n                supervisor electronically via Handshake Ready for what's next Request More Info Apply Now Explore Programs 3400 S. 43rd St. Milwaukee, WI 53219 414-382-6000 admissions@alverno.edu Campus Map Mesa Location Contact Us Employment at Alverno Event Spaces Faculty Directory Trustees Privacy Policy Faculty & Staff Intranet Accreditation Harassment/Discrimination Policy Web Accessibility Statement Institutional Review Board © Alverno College, All Rights Reserved"
