      "title": "Handshake",
      "description": "Handshake | Career Studio | Alverno College https://alverno.studentadvisor.ai/virtualadvisor Alverno News Faculty Experts News/Blog Alverno Magazine Athletics Visit Events Alumnae Give My Alverno Search by Keywords\n                  Here Academics & Admissions Academics Majors and Programs List Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Adult Learning & Degree Completion Transfer Students International Students Tuition & Aid Tuition Financial Aid Scholarships Admissions Visit Meet an Admissions Counselor Accepted Students Support & Career Center for Academic Excellence Internships Only at Alverno Research Center for Women and Girls Thea Bowman Institute for Excellence and Leadership Registration Office of the Registrar Register for Classes Catalogs & Policies Campus Visit Us The best way to know if Alverno is right for you is to come visit! About Alverno About A Hispanic-Serving Institution First-Generation College Students Where All Belong Alverno's President Campus Events Campus Life Residence Life Dining Services Student Engagement Greenhouse Campus Ministry Campus Safety Store A-Store (Alverno Gear) Resources Academic Academic Advising Career Studio Center for Learning and Assessment Support Library/Archives Student Development and Success Study Abroad Technology Media Hub Tech Services Registration Office of the Registrar Register for Classes Accounts Student Accounts Financial Aid Health & Safety Wellness Campus Safety Additional Resources Resources for Parents All Student Resources Internal Event Brand Guide Alverno Publications Abilities 8 Abilities Center for Learning and Assessment Support Volunteer Assessor Program Assessment Workshops and Consulting Request Info Apply Menu Close Search by Keywords\n                  Here Academics & Admission Academics Majors and Programs List Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Adult Learning & Degree Completion Transfer Students International Students Tuition & Aid Tuition Financial Aid Scholarships Admissions Visit Meet an Admissions Counselor Accepted Students Support & Career Center for Academic Excellence Internships Only at Alverno Research Center for Women and Girls Thea Bowman Institute for Excellence and Leadership Registration Office of the Registrar Register for Classes Catalogs & Policies Campus Visit Us About Alverno About A Hispanic-Serving Institution First-Generation College Students Where All Belong Alverno's President Campus Events Campus Life Residence Life Dining Services Student Activities Greenhouse Campus Ministry Campus Safety Store A-Store (Alverno Gear) Resources Academic Academic Advising Career Studio Instructional Services Library Student Development and Success Study Abroad Technology Media Hub Tech Services Registration Office of the Registrar Register for Classes Accounts Student Accounts Financial Aid Health & Safety Wellness Campus Safety Additional Resources Resources for Parents All Student Resources Internal Event Brand Guide Alverno Publications 8 Abilities 8 Abilities Center for Learning and Assessment Support Volunteer Assessor Program Assessment Workshops & Consulting Alverno News Faculty Experts News/Blog A Magazine Apply Request Info Athletics Visit Events Alumnae Give My Alverno Career Education Handshake Career Student Resources Career Coaching Internship Advising Internship Advising Forms Recent Internships Handshake Alum Resources Handshake Employer Resources Hire an Intern Recruit a Grad Handshake Internship Forms Community Resources Online Resources Career Studio Team Office Hours & Contact Info Handshake Student Login Student Login Alverno College students can login here to schedule an appointment with a career coach, access job and internship postings, connect with employers, and view upcoming career events via\n        Handshake, the leading platform for college recruiting. Alum Login Alum Login Alverno College alums can use Handshake to access job postings, connect with employers, view upcoming career events (including virtual events) and, for those who graduated within the\n        past year, schedule an appointment with a career coach. Please Note: If you graduated within the past 6 months, you can login using your Alverno credentials . If it has been longer than that, use the same link, but select \" sign in with your email address \" and enter your personal email address (e.g. Gmail or Ymail). If you graduated more\n        than 6 months ago and have not updated your account with a personal email address, or never had one, you will need to set up a new account here . Employer Login Employer Login Alverno College is now on Handshake , the leading platform for college recruiting! To learn more and create an account,\n        go to Handshake's employer page . Please note: jobs based in a private residence\n        (e.g., personal caregiver, baby-sitter, etc.) will not be approved on Handshake. Ready for what's next Request More Info Apply Now Explore Programs 3400 S. 43rd St. Milwaukee, WI 53219 414-382-6000 admissions@alverno.edu Campus Map Mesa Location Contact Us Employment at Alverno Event Spaces Faculty Directory Trustees Privacy Policy Faculty & Staff Intranet Accreditation Harassment/Discrimination Policy Web Accessibility Statement Institutional Review Board © Alverno College, All Rights Reserved"
    },
